action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P50 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): arrowEdge bottom puts the panel below its button.
# Measured from p50-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-024834.png (1560x1856 for the 780x928 window, native title
# bar, origin=frame, pixels halved): Show title B (292,435), Open the first panel (239,656), Cycle arrow
# edge (191,700); inside PANEL ALPHA, press me at (80,132). GTK spaces text more loosely than AppKit, so
# the AppKit file's (231,677) and (273,457) land in gaps between buttons here. Before this file
# existed the 2026-10-16 gtk4 sweep replayed the AppKit coordinates: five files "passed" with no
# button pressed, and panel-press-me failed with no popover open.
# GTK 的文字間距比 AppKit 寬，AppKit 檔的座標在這裡落在按鈕之間的空隙;座標量自上述擷圖(點)。
sleep,,,,,,1200000,let P50 lay out,macos
click,191,700,frame,left,,,cycle 1: none -> top,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
click,191,700,frame,left,,,cycle 2: top -> bottom; the readout must say bottom,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
click,239,656,frame,left,,,open PANEL ALPHA with arrowEdge bottom; the panel must open BELOW its button,macos
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let the popover appear,macos
